    </node>
    <node id="r_143">
      <data key="type">movie</data>
      <data key="title">The Game</data>
      <data key="year">1997</data>
      <data key="data">In honor of his birthday, San Francisco banker Nicholas Van Orton, a financial genius and a cold-hearted loner, receives an unusual present from his younger brother, Conrad: a gift certificate to play a unique kind of game. In nary a nanosecond, Nicholas finds himself consumed by a dangerous set of ever-changing rules, unable to distinguish where the charade ends and reality begins.</data>
      <data key="genres">Drama, Thriller, Mystery</data>
