      <data key="title">The Professional</data>
      <data key="year">1994</data>
      <data key="data">Léon, the top hit man in New York, has earned a rep as an effective &quot;cleaner&quot;. But when his next-door neighbors are wiped out by a loose-cannon DEA agent, he becomes the unwilling custodian of 12-year-old Mathilda. Before long, Mathilda&#x27;s thoughts turn to revenge, and she considers following in Léon&#x27;s footsteps.</data>
