      <data key="data">Danielle, a vibrant young woman, was forced into servitude after the death of her father when she was a young girl. Danielle&#x27;s stepmother, Rodmilla, is a heartless woman who forces Danielle to do the cooking and cleaning, while she tries to marry off the eldest of her two daughters to the prince. But Danielle&#x27;s life takes a wonderful turn when, under the guise of a visiting royal, she meets the charming Prince Henry.</data>
