      <data key="title">Trainspotting</data>
      <data key="year">1995</data>
      <data key="data">Three teenage brothers, gang-member Bobby, troubled mama&#x27;s boy Alan and self-assured prankster Lex, reside in a downtrodden section of Glasgow, Scotland, circa 1968. But while Bobby and Alan are beginning to experience the power of raging hormones, the story focuses on Lex, who begins a downward spiral after he accidentally shoots the leader of Bobby&#x27;s gang. Lex&#x27;s cockiness and immaturity unfortunately prevent him from understanding the effect his subsequent crimes will have on both himself, and on those around him.</data>
