      <data key="data">When his boss is killed, Detroit cop Axel Foley finds evidence that the murderer had ties to a California amusement park called Wonder World. Returning to sunny Beverly Hills once more, Foley reunites with Detective Billy Rosewood to solve the case. Along with Billy&#x27;s new partner, Detective Jon Flint, they discover that Wonder World is being used as a front for a massive counterfeiting ring.</data>
