      <data key="data">Henry is a player skilled at seducing women. But when this veterinarian meets Lucy, a girl with a quirky problem when it comes to total recall, he realizes it&#x27;s possible to fall in love all over again…and again, and again. That&#x27;s because the delightful Lucy has no short-term memory, so Henry must woo her day after day until he finally sweeps her off her feet.</data>
