      <data key="year">2002</data>
      <data key="data">The true story of pianist Władysław Szpilman&#x27;s experiences in Warsaw during the Nazi occupation. When the Jews of the city find themselves forced into a ghetto, Szpilman finds work playing in a café; and when his family is deported in 1942, he stays behind, works for a while as a laborer, and eventually goes into hiding in the ruins of the war-torn city.</data>
