      <data key="data">Deloris Van Cartier is again asked to don the nun&#x27;s habit to help a run-down Catholic school, presided over by Mother Superior. And if trying to reach out to a class full of uninterested students wasn&#x27;t bad enough, the sisters discover that the school is due to be closed by the unscrupulous chief of a local authority.</data>
