    <node id="r_3427">
      <data key="type">movie</data>
      <data key="title">Men in Black II</data>
      <data key="year">2002</data>
      <data key="data">Kay and Jay reunite to provide our best, last and only line of defense against a sinister seductress who levels the toughest challenge yet to the MIB&#x27;s untarnished mission statement – protecting Earth from the scum of the universe. It&#x27;s been four years since the alien-seeking agents averted an intergalactic disaster of epic proportions. Now it&#x27;s a race against the clock as Jay must convince Kay – who not only has absolutely no memory of his time spent with the MIB, but is also the only living person left with the expertise to save the galaxy – to reunite with the MIB before the earth submits to ultimate destruction.</data>
      <data key="genres">Action, Comedy, Science Fiction</data>
