      <data key="data">A 1939 test pilot asks his best friend to use him as a guinea pig for a cryogenics experiment. Daniel McCormick wants to be frozen for a year so that he doesn&#x27;t have to watch his love lying in a coma. The next thing Daniel knows is that he&#x27;s been awoken in 1992.</data>
