      <data key="title">End of Days</data>
      <data key="year">1999</data>
      <data key="data">Cynical bodyguard Jericho is hired by a man possessed by Satan, who is in search of his bride. When Jericho realizes what is happening, he must do everything he can to save the woman and the world.</data>
