      <data key="title">Overboard</data>
      <data key="year">1987</data>
      <data key="data">Heiress Joanna Stayton hires carpenter Dean Proffitt to build a closet on her yacht—and refuses to pay him for the project when it&#x27;s done. But after Joanna accidentally falls overboard and loses her memory, Dean sees an opportunity to get even.</data>
