      <data key="year">2000</data>
      <data key="data">Trapped near the summit of K2, the world&#x27;s second-highest mountain, Annie Garrett radios to base camp for help. Brother Peter hears Annie&#x27;s message and assembles a team to save her and her group before they succumb to K2&#x27;s unforgiving elements. But, as Annie lays injured in an icy cavern, the rescuers face several terrifying events that could end the rescue attempt -- and their lives.</data>
