      <data key="data">Leonard Shelby is tracking down the man who raped and murdered his wife. The difficulty of locating his wife&#x27;s killer, however, is compounded by the fact that he suffers from a rare, untreatable form of short-term memory loss. Although he can recall details of life before his accident, Leonard cannot remember what happened fifteen minutes ago, where he&#x27;s going, or why.</data>
