      <data key="data">In the post-apocalyptic future, reigning tyrannical supercomputers teleport a cyborg assassin known as the &quot;Terminator&quot; back to 1984 to kill Sarah Connor, whose unborn son is destined to lead insurgents against 21st century mechanical hegemony. Meanwhile, the human-resistance movement dispatches a lone warrior to safeguard Sarah. Can he stop the virtually indestructible killing machine?</data>
