      <data key="data">Dr. Malcolm Sayer, a shy research physician, uses an experimental drug to &quot;awaken&quot; the catatonic victims of a rare disease. Leonard is the first patient to receive the controversial treatment. His awakening, filled with awe and enthusiasm, proves a rebirth for Sayer too, as the exuberant patient reveals life&#x27;s simple but unutterably sweet pleasures to the introverted doctor.</data>
