      <data key="year">1992</data>
      <data key="data">The Newton family live in their comfortable home, but there seems to something missing. This &quot;hole&quot; is filled by a small puppy, who walks into their home and their lives. Beethoven, as he is named, grows into a giant of a dog... a St Bernard. Doctor Varnick, the local vet has a secret and horrible sideline, which requires lots of dogs for experiments. Beethoven is on the bad doctor&#x27;s list.</data>
