      <data key="title">Racing Stripes</data>
      <data key="year">2005</data>
      <data key="data">Shattered illusions are hard to repair -- especially for a good-hearted zebra named Stripes who&#x27;s spent his life on a Kentucky farm amidst the sorely mistaken notion that he&#x27;s a debonair thoroughbred. Once he faces the fact that his stark stripes mark him as different, he decides he&#x27;ll race anyway. And with help from the young girl who raised him, he just might end up in the winner&#x27;s circle.</data>
