      <data key="year">1999</data>
      <data key="data">Countless wiseguy films are spoofed in this film that centers on the neuroses and angst of a powerful Mafia racketeer who suffers from panic attacks. When Paul Vitti needs help dealing with his role in the &quot;family,&quot; unlucky shrink Dr. Ben Sobel is given just days to resolve Vitti&#x27;s emotional crisis and turn him into a happy, well-adjusted gangster.</data>
