      <data key="year">1998</data>
      <data key="data">Poker addict Mike McDermott knows the game inside out, but loses his money one night in a game to Russian-American gangster Teddy KGB. Promising his partner Jo he&#x27;ll give up, he meets up with best friend Lester &#x27;Worm&#x27; Murphy, just out of prison and owing lots of money to the wrong kind of people. McDermott becomes his co-guarantor and now there&#x27;s only one way to raise the money, the pair have to get back into the game.</data>
