    <node id="r_9049">
      <data key="type">movie</data>
      <data key="title">Boogie Nights</data>
      <data key="year">1997</data>
      <data key="data">Set in 1977, back when sex was safe, pleasure was a business and business was booming, idealistic porn producer Jack Horner aspires to elevate his craft to an art form. Horner discovers Eddie Adams, a hot young talent working as a busboy in a nightclub, and welcomes him into the extended family of movie-makers, misfits and hangers-on that are always around. Adams&#x27; rise from nobody to a celebrity adult entertainer is meteoric, and soon the whole world seems to know his porn alter ego, &quot;Dirk Diggler&quot;. Now, when disco and drugs are in vogue, fashion is in flux and the party never seems to stop, Adams&#x27; dreams of turning sex into stardom are about to collide with cold, hard reality.</data>
