    <node id="r_9111">
      <data key="type">movie</data>
      <data key="title">Kiss the Girls</data>
      <data key="year">1997</data>
      <data key="data">Forensic psychologist and detective Alex Cross travels to North Carolina and teams with escaped kidnap victim Kate McTiernan to hunt down &quot;Casanova,&quot; a serial killer who abducts strong-willed women and forces them to submit to his demands. The trail leads to Los Angeles, where the duo discovers that the psychopath may not be working alone.</data>
