      <data key="data">After taking his dying father&#x27;s advice, Hal dates only the embodiments of female physical perfection. But that all changes after Hal has an unexpected run-in with self-help guru Tony Robbins. Intrigued by Hal&#x27;s shallowness, Robbins hypnotizes him into seeing the beauty that exists even in the least physically appealing women. Hal soon falls for Rosemary, but he doesn&#x27;t realize that his gorgeous girlfriend is actually a 300-pound-not-so-hottie.</data>
