      <data key="title">The Great Escape</data>
      <data key="year">1963</data>
      <data key="data">The Nazis, exasperated at the number of escapes from their prison camps by a relatively small number of Allied prisoners, relocate them to a high-security &#x27;escape-proof&#x27; camp to sit out the remainder of the war. Undaunted, the prisoners plan one of the most ambitious escape attempts of World War II. Based on a true story.</data>
