      <data key="title">Adaptation</data>
      <data key="year">2002</data>
      <data key="data">Charlie Kaufman is a confused L.A. screenwriter overwhelmed by feelings of inadequacy, sexual frustration, self-loathing, and by the screenwriting ambitions of his freeloading twin brother Donald. While struggling to adapt &quot;The Orchid Thief,&quot; by Susan Orlean, Kaufman&#x27;s life spins from pathetic to bizarre. The lives of Kaufman, Orlean&#x27;s book, become strangely intertwined as each one&#x27;s search for passion collides with the others&#x27;.</data>
