      <data key="data">Matt Sullivan&#x27;s last big relationship ended in disaster and ever since his heart&#x27;s been aching and his commitment&#x27;s been lacking. Then came Lent, that time of year when everybody gives something up. That&#x27;s when Matt decides to go where no man&#x27;s gone before and make a vow: No sex. Whatsoever. For 40 straight days. At first he has everything under control. That is until the woman of his dreams, Erica, walks into his life.</data>
