      <data key="year">1979</data>
      <data key="data">After discovering he&#x27;s not really black like the rest of his family, likable dimwit Navin Johnson sets off on a hilarious misadventure that takes him from rags to riches and back again. The slaphappy jerk strikes it rich, but life in the fast lane isn&#x27;t all it&#x27;s cracked up to be and, in the end, all that really matters to Johnson is his true love.</data>
