    <node id="r_12293">
      <data key="type">movie</data>
      <data key="title">The Godfather</data>
      <data key="year">1972</data>
      <data key="data">Spanning the years 1945 to 1955, a chronicle of the fictional Italian-American Corleone crime family. When organized crime family patriarch, Vito Corleone barely survives an attempt on his life, his youngest son, Michael steps in to take care of the would-be killers, launching a campaign of bloody revenge.</data>
