      <data key="year">2002</data>
      <data key="data">Dedicated environmental lawyer Lucy Kelson goes to work for billionaire George Wade as part of a deal to preserve a community center. Indecisive and weak-willed George grows dependent on Lucy&#x27;s guidance on everything from legal matters to clothing. Exasperated, Lucy gives notice and picks Harvard graduate June Carter as her replacement. As Lucy&#x27;s time at the firm nears an end, she grows jealous of June and has second thoughts about leaving George.</data>
