    <node id="r_13471">
      <data key="type">movie</data>
      <data key="title">Jersey Girl</data>
      <data key="year">2004</data>
      <data key="data">Ollie Trinke is a young, suave music publicist who seems to have it all, with a new wife and a baby on the way. But life deals him a bum hand when he&#x27;s suddenly faced with single fatherhood, a defunct career and having to move in with his father. To bounce back, it takes a new love and the courage instilled in him by his daughter.</data>
