    <node id="r_13763">
      <data key="type">movie</data>
      <data key="title">Jerry Maguire</data>
      <data key="year">1996</data>
      <data key="data">Jerry Maguire used to be a typical sports agent: willing to do just about anything he could to get the biggest possible contracts for his clients, plus a nice commission for himself. Then, one day, he suddenly has second thoughts about what he&#x27;s really doing. When he voices these doubts, he ends up losing his job and all of his clients, save Rod Tidwell, an egomaniacal football player.</data>
