      <data key="data">When North Korean ruler Kim Jong-il orchestrates a global terrorist plot, it&#x27;s up to the heavily armed, highly specialized Team America unit to stop his dastardly scheme. The group, which has recruited troubled Broadway actor Gary Johnston, not only has to face off against Jong-il, but they must also contend with the Film Actors Guild, a cadre of Hollywood liberals at odds with Team America&#x27;s &#x27;policing the world&#x27; tactics.</data>
