      <data key="year">2004</data>
      <data key="data">When college coach Herb Brooks is hired to helm the 1980 U.S. men&#x27;s Olympic hockey team, he brings a unique and brash style to the ice. After assembling a team of hot-headed college all-stars, who are humiliated in an early match, Brooks unites his squad against a common foe: the heavily-favored Soviet team.</data>
