      <data key="data">Clear the runway for Derek Zoolander, VH1&#x27;s three-time male model of the year. His face falls when hippie-chic Hansel scooters in to steal this year&#x27;s award. The evil fashion guru Mugatu seizes the opportunity to turn Derek into a killing machine. It&#x27;s a well-designed conspiracy and only with the help of Hansel and a few well-chosen accessories like Matilda can Derek make the world safe for male models everywhere.</data>
