      <data key="year">2002</data>
      <data key="data">A rush-hour fender-bender on New York City&#x27;s crowded FDR Drive, under most circumstances, wouldn&#x27;t set off a chain reaction that could decimate two people&#x27;s lives. But on this day, at this time, a minor collision will turn two complete strangers into vicious adversaries. Their means of destroying each other might be different, but their goals, ultimately, will be the same: Each will systematically try to dismantle the other&#x27;s life in a reckless effort to reclaim something he has lost.</data>
