      <data key="title">Nurse Betty</data>
      <data key="year">2000</data>
      <data key="data">What happens when a person decides that life is merely a state of mind? If you&#x27;re Betty, a small-town waitress and soap opera fan from Fair Oaks, Kansas, you refuse to believe that you can&#x27;t be with the love of your life just because he doesn&#x27;t really exist. After all, life is no excuse for not living. Traumatized by a savage event, Betty enters into a fugue state that allows -- even encourages -- her to keep functioning... in a kind of alternate reality.</data>
