      <data key="title">The Ring Two</data>
      <data key="year">2005</data>
      <data key="data">After the ordeal with Samara, Rachel and Aiden move to a rural town. But soon Rachel learns about the death of a girl in a similar fashion. To save Aiden, she must dig into Samara&#x27;s past even further.</data>
